repository-code: 'https://github.com/sixarm/thing-matcher-rust-crate/'
abstract: >-
  Deterministic and probabilistic matching of geographic places
  (landmarks, natural features, chain branches, administrative areas)
  for de-duplication and record linkage. Combines Haversine distance,
  external place identifiers (Google, OSM, Wikidata, GeoNames, and
  others), ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country codes, coarse-grained categories,
  and weight-renormalised per-field score breakdowns.
keywords:
  - place
  - matching
  - geographic
  - geocoding
  - deduplication
